Package: com.liehuu.shortcutslagfix
Name: ShortcutsLagFix
Version: 1.0.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Diagnose and mitigate UI stalls when creating a new Shortcut (iOS 17). Includes a main-thread hang watchdog that captures the blocking stack, plus optional low-risk optimizations. All hooks use public UIKit APIs only.
